+/*
+ * The engine's DMA interface.  A QUPv3 serial engine is loaded with its
+ * protocol firmware and its transfer mode by the bootloader (geni_load_se_fw:
+ * SE_DMA_IF_EN, SE_FIFO_IF_DISABLE), after which GENI_IF_DISABLE_RO@0x64 reads
